You activate a special mode of your golem, boosting its regeneration rate by [49, 63, 73, 83, 91 (TL1-5; SP 100)] life per turn for 7 turns.

If your golem was dead, it is instantly brought back to life with [26%, 35%, 41%, 46%, 50% (TL1-5)] life.

While supercharged, your golem is enraged and deals 25% more damage.
